One of the rewards from [[VIP Loyalty Program]].

You can select one of the following rewards:

* 3 {{Item|Jeweler's Tool Kit}}s
* 3 {{Item|Sentience Toolkit}}s
* 5 {{Item|Slayer_Count_Boost#Greater_Slayer_Count_Boost|Greater Slayer Count Boost Elixirs}}
* {{Item|Ethereal Rest Shrine Statuette}}
* [[Siberys Dragonshard | Flawless Siberys Dragonshard]] (Feat swap token)
* {{Item|Sentient XP|Sentient XP: 5000xp}}&dagger;
* 80 {{Item|Glamerdust}}
* {{Item|Mirror of Glamering}}
* 2500 {{Item|Omnispell Dust}}
* {{Item|Raid Timer Bypass Hourglass}}
* {{Item|Raid Timer Bypass Hourglass|Legendary Raid Timer Bypass Hourglass}}

&dagger; When originally released, this item mistakenly claimed to offer 6000 Sentient XP rather than 5000. This was a bug that has since been rectified, and those that claimed the bag before the issue was fixed were eligible for a compensation reward for the following month.

